<title>OMAN: Muscat 1995 CPI drops 1.3 percent year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Muscat 1995 CPI drops 1.3 percent year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Central Bank said in its annual report that the consumer price index in the capital Muscat dropped 1.3 percent in 1995. The report was carried by the official Omani news agency.</p>
<p>Percentage change over one year:</p>
<p>							1995</p>
<p> Muscat CPI					 -1.3</p>
<p>  Rents, fuel, water and power index	-9.8</p>
<p>  Foods, beverages and tobacco index	+1.5</p>
</text>
